<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan to auction Federal Investment Bonds.</title>
<headline>Pakistan to auction Federal Investment Bonds.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan said on Thursday it had invited tenders by Monday for the sale of the government's Federal Investment Bonds.</p>
<p>Auction result would be announced on Tuesday and deposits would be accepted on Wednesday on June 9, the bank said.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
